  "title": "Korea's WGBI Inclusion Is Driving a New Phase of Investor Engagement",
  "summary": "Korea’s inclusion in the FTSE World Government Bond Index is creating a new phase of global investor engagement with Korean Treasury Bonds. As market reforms improve accessibility and settlement options, international investors are increasingly evaluating KTBs for benchmark exposure, diversification, collateral use and broader fixed income strategies. Tradeweb explores how electronic trading, transparent pricing and efficient workflows are helping global and domestic market participants access Korea’s bond market more effectively.",
